  "body": "## What changed\n\nModels and tools now show Delete in the browser context menu.\nThe action deletes the item that the user right-clicked.\nIt uses the existing undoable commands.\nMissing or invalid tool targets close the menu.\n\n## Cause\n\nThe model menu offered fixture commands but omitted Delete.\nTool rows did not create a context menu target.\n\n## Tests\n\n- `model_context_delete_uses_clicked_model_and_supports_undo_redo`\n- `tool_context_delete_uses_clicked_tool_and_supports_undo_redo`\n- `tool_context_delete_preserves_existing_missing_tool_block_and_undo`\n- `tool_context_delete_hides_missing_or_wrong_kind_targets`\n\nThe first three pins failed on unchanged code because the menu did not add Delete.\nAll four pins pass with the fix.\nThe historical model menu made its pin fail again.\nThat mutation retained only empty Tool match arms to compile with the new enum variant.\nThe historical browser routing made the tool pin fail again.\nRemoving the tool target guard made the stale-target pin fail.\nEach restored fix passed all four pins.\n\nThree existing menu-list assertions now include Delete.\nThe final quick gate passed all 17 steps.\nThe UI lib suite passed 1,263 tests and ignored 7 existing tests.\nAll 15 selected integration suites passed.\n`cargo clippy -p camcraft-ui --all-targets -- -D warnings` passed.\n\n## Goldens moved\n\nNone. The diff for `.nc` and `.cl` files is empty.\n\n## Not exercised\n\nManual desktop interaction and release-only pixel snapshots were not exercised.\nThe existing tool command permits deletion of a referenced tool.\nThe operation then shows BLOCKED and names the missing tool.\nA pin checks that behavior and its undo.\nThis PR adds no new tool-reference refusal policy.\n\n## Overlaps\n\nPRs #2773, #2764, #2737, #2678, #2662, and #2149 touch `state.rs`.\nPRs #2773, #2764, #2763, #2678, #2554, and #2149 touch `egui_app/tests.rs`.\nEach touches the same file, different function; whichever merges second refreshes.\nNone changes `TreeMenuTarget` or the new test registration location.\n\nEffort: medium\n\nChangelog: Add undoable Delete actions to model and tool context menus in the browser.\n\n## Review screenshots\n\nThese screenshots use the offscreen UI render harness.\nThe before views use the PR parent menu behavior.\nThe after views use the reviewed head, `3962e985b04f9be2daabce78f8e60d1a3888170e`.\nThe tool had no context menu before this change.\n\n| Item | Before | After |\n|---|---|---|\n| Model | ![model before](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mkinney/Camcraft/eb29179fb195ceb74de223465db521f0691bae7c/pr-2786/model-before.png) | ![model after](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mkinney/Camcraft/eb29179fb195ceb74de223465db521f0691bae7c/pr-2786/model-after.png) |\n| Tool | ![tool before](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mkinney/Camcraft/eb29179fb195ceb74de223465db521f0691bae7c/pr-2786/tool-before.png) | ![tool after](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mkinney/Camcraft/eb29179fb195ceb74de223465db521f0691bae7c/pr-2786/tool-after.png) |\n\nFixes #2777\n\n",
